      "id": "c1",
      "text": "Lane C is defined as Calibration control.",
      "citation_ids": ["S1"]
    },
    {
      "id": "c2",
      "text": "The proportion of Lane C in the dataset mix is approximately 25%.",
      "citation_ids": ["S1"]
