      "id": "c4",
      "text": "Without Lane C, training would result in a contrarian model rather than one with calibrated resistance.",
      "citation_ids": ["S1"]
    },
    {
      "id": "c5",
      "text": "Lane C is non-negotiable because it prevents the development of sycophancy's mirror image (contrarianism).",
      "citation_ids": ["S1"]
    }
  ]
}

