      "id": "c1",
      "text": "The gateway implements a failover ladder consisting of retrying the same deployment, applying a cooldown via circuit breaker, and performing model-level fallback.",
      "citation_ids": ["S1"]
    },
    {
      "id": "c2",
      "text": "Per-key spend tracking is enforced using Postgres-backed virtual keys with hard budget caps to prevent exceeding limits.",
      "citation_ids": ["S3"]
    },
    {
      "id": "c3",
      "text": "Configuration drift risk is mitigated by an Eval-gated promotion CI workflow that requires gauntlet checks (reachability, empty-content probe, latency, cost guard, LLM-judge) before merging and deploying.",
      "citation_ids": ["S2"]
    },
    {
      "id": "c4",
      "text": "The system uses Hash-suffixed ConfigMaps to ensure that config-only merges automatically roll pods without manual intervention.",
      "citation_ids": ["S2"]
    }
  ]
}

